# AdventOS inittab — services started by init at boot.
#
# Format:  <mode> <program> [args...]
#   once    : run once, don't restart on exit
#   respawn : restart whenever this exits (dead-job loop guard)
#
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.

once httpd.elf
once httpsd.elf
once sshd.elf
# Session 64: JSON-RPC tool surface for external agents on loopback.
respawn agentd.elf
# Session 67 wired headless serial keyboard input, so sh boots straight
# to an interactive prompt now. The selftest battery (t1..t49) used to
# run as part of this line — added "selftest" as argv[1] to trigger it
# in user/sh.c's main. Dropped for boot speed; the selftest() body is
# still in sh.c, just unreached at boot. Bring it back temporarily by
# editing this line to `once sh.elf selftest` and rebuilding.
once sh.elf
